      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Alex%20Klenman\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Alex Klenman</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">October 2017</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Klenman is an experienced junior mining executive whose career spans over 30 years in the private and public sectors. Over the past decade he has held a number of senior management and board positions in the public markets.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Vivian%20Katsuris\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Vivian Katsuris</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">October 2017</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Secretary</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Katsuris has over 25 years of experience in the brokerage industry and the junior capital markets. She has served as a director and officer of several public companies.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Trevor%20Perkins\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Trevor Perkins</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Vice President, Exploration</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Perkins is a professional geologist with over 25 years of experience in mineral exploration, including 10 years with Cameco Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Saurabh%20Handa\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Saurabh Handa</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">June 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Handa is a Chartered Professional Accountant with over 15 years of experience in the mining industry.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Alex%20Klenman\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Alex Klenman</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">October 2017</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Klenman is an experienced junior mining executive whose career spans over 30 years in the private and public sectors.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Ted%20O'Connor\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Ted O'Connor</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">October 2017</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. O'Connor has over 25 years of experience in the uranium industry, including 19 years with Cameco Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Paul%20Gill\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Paul Gill</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2011</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Gill is the President of AJS Management Inc., a company providing management consulting services.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Saurabh%20Handa\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Saurabh Handa</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">June 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Handa is a Chartered Professional Accountant with over 15 years of experience in the mining industry.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sources</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://azincourtenergy.com/about/management-directors/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Company Website - Management and Directors Page</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-05-22)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sedarplus.ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Management Information Circular</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2023-11-24)</span></li></ul>"
